#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:2
msgid "Joint and Body Ordering"
msgstr "关节与刚体顺序"

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:4
msgid ""
"PhysX and MJWarp may order an articulation's joints and bodies differently. "
"Set ``joint_ordering`` and ``body_ordering`` to keep names mapped to the "
"same tensor elements across backends. This page explains the supported "
"conventions, conversion costs, and direct backend-view access. For backend "
"selection and capabilities, see :doc:`Physics Backends <physics_backends>`."
msgstr ""
"PhysX 与 MJWarp 对关节体中的关节和刚体可能采用不同顺序。设置 ``joint_ordering`` 和 ``body_ordering``"
" ，可以在不同后端之间保持名称与张量元素的对应关系。本页介绍受支持的顺序约定、转换开销，以及如何直接访问后端视图。后端选择与功能见 :doc:`物理后端"
" <physics_backends>` 。"

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:12
msgid ""
"For policy transfer instructions and validated examples, see "
":doc:`/source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton`."
msgstr ""
"策略迁移说明和已验证示例见 :doc:`/source/how-"
"to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton` 。"

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:17
msgid "Why Articulation Orders Differ"
msgstr "为什么关节体顺序不同"

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:19
msgid ""
"Three facts explain why a checkpoint can need an ordering convention even "
"when both backends load the same USD asset:"
msgstr "即使两个后端加载相同的 USD 资源，检查点仍可能需要指定顺序约定，原因如下："

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:22
msgid ""
"USD names identify physical joints and bodies, but they do not impose one "
"universal tensor-axis order across solvers."
msgstr "USD 名称标识物理关节和刚体，但不会规定各求解器必须采用相同的张量轴顺序。"

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:24
msgid ""
"PhysX and MJWarp construct native articulation views with different topology"
" traversal and internal representation choices."
msgstr "PhysX 与 MJWarp 采用不同的拓扑遍历和内部表示方式，构建原生关节体视图。"

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:26
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab resolves the requested names once during articulation "
"initialization, then exposes the selected public order through its high-"
"level API."
msgstr "Isaac Lab 在关节体初始化时解析一次所请求的名称，之后通过高层 API 暴露选定的公共顺序。"

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:30
msgid ""
"The backend selection described in :ref:`backend-architecture` controls "
"which native view is created. The ordering selection controls how the high-"
"level API presents that view."
msgstr ":ref:`backend-architecture` 中介绍的后端选择决定创建哪一种原生视图；顺序选择决定高层 API 如何呈现该视图。"

