#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:92
msgid ""
"``None`` is the zero-conversion default. Public names follow the active "
"backend, no ordering map is installed, no reorder staging is allocated, and "
"no reorder kernel is launched. An explicit convention or name sequence that "
"resolves to backend order is normalized to ``None`` at initialization after "
"a one-time name resolution, so it reaches the exact same zero-conversion "
"state: a non-``None`` ordering map always denotes an actual permutation."
msgstr ""
"``None`` "
"是无需转换的默认值。公共名称遵循当前后端，不建立顺序映射，不分配重排暂存区，也不启动重排内核。显式约定或名称序列如果最终解析为后端顺序，会在初始化时经过一次名称解析后规范化为"
" ``None`` ，从而达到完全相同的零转换状态。因此，非 ``None`` 的顺序映射始终表示实际发生了排列变换。"

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:100
msgid ""
"After configuring an ordering, confirm the resolved public axis by comparing"
" :attr:`~isaaclab.assets.Articulation.joint_names` with "
":attr:`~isaaclab.assets.Articulation.backend_joint_names` (and "
"``body_names`` with ``backend_body_names``). Cross-backend conventions are "
"resolved by emulation, so spot-check the result against the order your "
"checkpoint expects."
msgstr ""
"配置顺序后，比较 :attr:`~isaaclab.assets.Articulation.joint_names` 与 "
":attr:`~isaaclab.assets.Articulation.backend_joint_names` ，以及 ``body_names``"
" 与 ``backend_body_names`` "
"，确认解析后的公共轴顺序。跨后端约定通过模拟对应后端的顺序规则解析，因此应抽查结果是否符合检查点的预期顺序。"

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:107
msgid "High-Level MDP Terms"
msgstr "高层 MDP 项"

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:109
msgid ""
"Standard MDP terms that consume high-level articulation data use public "
"indices. This includes terms that resolve joint or body selections by name "
"and then index public-order :class:`~isaaclab.assets.ArticulationData` "
"properties or call high-level articulation writers."
msgstr ""
"使用高层关节体数据的标准 MDP 项采用公共索引，包括按名称解析关节或刚体选择后，索引公共顺序下的 "
":class:`~isaaclab.assets.ArticulationData` 属性，或调用高层关节体写入器的项。"

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:114
msgid ""
"Material randomization crosses the backend boundary explicitly: it converts "
"selected public body IDs to backend body IDs before deriving the "
"corresponding backend shape ranges. Custom or backend-specific MDP code that"
" accesses ``root_view`` bypasses these high-level conversions and must "
"convert its own indices and tensors."
msgstr ""
"材质随机化会显式跨越后端边界：先将选定的公共刚体 ID 转换为后端刚体 ID，再计算相应的后端形状范围。访问 ``root_view`` "
"的自定义或后端专用 MDP 代码绕过了这些高层转换，必须自行转换索引和张量。"

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:122
msgid "Conversion Cost"
msgstr "转换开销"

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:124
msgid ""
"Convention resolution and map construction are one-time initialization work."
" For a nonidentity map, affected reads and writes can require persistent "
"staging memory plus gather/scatter kernel launches. Identity maps avoid "
"those ongoing conversion paths."
msgstr ""
"约定解析和映射构建只在初始化时进行一次。对于非恒等映射，受影响的读写可能需要持久暂存内存，以及 gather/scatter "
"内核调用。恒等映射避免了这些持续转换路径。"

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:129
msgid ""
"On the Newton backend, a nonidentity ordering additionally records a fixed "
"per-step reorder of the core state buffers -- joint positions and "
"velocities, body poses and velocities -- inside the stepped and CUDA-graph-"
"captured region. This publishes backend-order state into the public-order "
"buffers every step, so a small baseline per-step cost exists independent of "
"how often properties are accessed."
msgstr ""
"在 Newton 后端中，非恒等顺序还会在步进及 CUDA "
"图捕获区域内，记录每一步固定的核心状态缓冲区重排，包括关节位置和速度、刚体位姿和速度。每一步都会将后端顺序状态写入公共顺序缓冲区，因此存在较小的固定步进开销，与访问属性的频率无关。"

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:136
msgid ""
"The runtime and memory cost scales with environment count, joint or body "
"count, and how often affected properties and writers are accessed. Measure "
"the specific task and access pattern; there is no hardware-independent "
"steps-per-second number or fixed percentage overhead."
msgstr ""
"运行时间和内存开销随环境数量、关节或刚体数量，以及受影响属性和写入器的访问频率而变化。应测量具体任务与访问模式；不存在与硬件无关的每秒步数或固定开销比例。"

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:143
msgid "Direct Backend-View Access"
msgstr "直接访问后端视图"

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:146
msgid ""
"Arrays returned by the raw solver view (``root_view``) are always in backend"
" solver order, regardless of the configured ``joint_ordering`` or "
"``body_ordering``. Indices from ``joint_names``, ``body_names``, "
"``find_joints``, or ``find_bodies`` are in public order and must not be used"
" to index ``root_view`` arrays directly. Use the asset's ``data`` buffers "
"and write APIs, which already operate in public order, or translate indices "
"through the asset's ``joint_ordering``/``body_ordering`` maps first."
msgstr ""
"原始求解器视图（ ``root_view`` ）返回的数组始终采用后端求解器顺序，不受 ``joint_ordering`` 或 "
"``body_ordering`` 配置影响。 ``joint_names`` 、 ``body_names`` 、 ``find_joints`` 和"
" ``find_bodies`` 提供的是公共顺序索引，不能直接用于索引 ``root_view`` 数组。请使用已按公共顺序工作的资源 "
"``data`` 缓冲区与写入 API，或先通过资源的 ``joint_ordering``/``body_ordering`` 映射转换索引。"

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:155
msgid ""
"Prefer the high-level articulation API when possible; its data and writer "
"contracts already use public order. Direct ``root_view`` access uses backend"
" order even when ``joint_names`` or ``body_names`` uses another convention. "
"When a small set of indices needs to cross into a view array, translate them"
" with :meth:`~isaaclab.assets.Articulation.map_joint_ids_to_backend` or "
":meth:`~isaaclab.assets.Articulation.map_body_ids_to_backend` instead of "
"indexing the ordering maps by hand; both return the input unchanged under "
"identity ordering."
msgstr ""
"尽可能使用高层关节体 API，其数据和写入约定均采用公共顺序。即使 ``joint_names`` 或 ``body_names`` "
"使用其他约定，直接访问 ``root_view`` 仍采用后端顺序。当少量索引需要用于视图数组时，使用 "
":meth:`~isaaclab.assets.Articulation.map_joint_ids_to_backend` 或 "
":meth:`~isaaclab.assets.Articulation.map_body_ids_to_backend` "
"转换，而不是手动索引顺序映射；恒等顺序下，两者均原样返回输入。"

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:165
msgid "Torch Conversion"
msgstr "Torch 转换"

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:167
msgid ""
"To gather a backend-order joint tensor into public order, enumerate public "
"output columns and use ``user_to_backend_indices`` to select the matching "
"backend source columns:"
msgstr "将后端顺序的关节张量转换为公共顺序时，枚举公共输出列，并通过 ``user_to_backend_indices`` 选择对应的后端源列："

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:179
msgid ""
"For the opposite direction, enumerate backend output columns and use "
"``backend_to_user_indices`` to select the matching public source columns:"
msgstr "反方向转换时，枚举后端输出列，并通过 ``backend_to_user_indices`` 选择对应的公共源列："

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:190
msgid ""
"Use ``robot.body_ordering`` in the same way for body-indexed axes. Keep the "
"``None`` guard because it avoids an unnecessary gather and means no map "
"object exists."
msgstr ""
"对于以刚体为索引的轴，以相同方式使用 ``robot.body_ordering`` 。保留对 ``None`` "
"的判断：它表示不存在映射对象，也能避免不必要的 gather 操作。"

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:195
msgid "Warp Conversion"
msgstr "Warp 转换"

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:197
msgid ""
"The elementwise reorder kernels in "
"``isaaclab.assets.articulation.ordering_kernels`` translate raw-view arrays "
"between backend and public order. For example, "
"``reorder_2d_backend_to_user`` gathers one ``(environment, joint)`` array "
"into public order:"
msgstr ""
"``isaaclab.assets.articulation.ordering_kernels`` "
"中的逐元素重排内核，将原始视图数组在后端顺序与公共顺序之间转换。例如， ``reorder_2d_backend_to_user`` 将一个 "
"``(environment, joint)`` 数组按公共顺序收集："

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:227
msgid ""
"The caller owns output allocation, launch dimensions, data type, and every "
"non-articulation axis. A public-to-backend gather uses "
"``ordering.backend_to_user``. Treat both device maps as read-only."
msgstr ""
"调用方负责输出分配、启动维度、数据类型，以及所有不属于关节体的轴。从公共顺序收集到后端顺序时，使用 "
"``ordering.backend_to_user`` 。两个设备端映射均应视为只读。"

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:231
msgid ""
"The ``reorder_2d`` and ``reorder_3d`` kernels, in both the "
"``*_backend_to_user`` and ``*_user_to_backend`` directions, form this public"
" elementwise family. All other kernels in "
"``isaaclab.assets.articulation.ordering_kernels`` are internal and may "
"change without deprecation."
msgstr ""
"``reorder_2d`` 和 ``reorder_3d`` 内核在 ``*_backend_to_user`` 与 "
"``*_user_to_backend`` 两个方向上，共同构成这组公开的逐元素重排接口。 "
"``isaaclab.assets.articulation.ordering_kernels`` 中其他内核均为内部实现，可能不经弃用流程就发生变化。"

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:236
msgid ""
"Joint maps cover named joints, not floating-base generalized coordinates. "
"When converting raw Jacobians or mass matrices, preserve the leading "
"``robot.num_base_dofs`` coordinates and offset mapped joint indices by that "
"count. Apply the joint permutation to both generalized-coordinate axes of a "
"mass matrix and leave all other axes unchanged."
msgstr ""
"关节映射只覆盖具名关节，不包含浮动基座的广义坐标。转换原始雅可比矩阵或质量矩阵时，保留开头的 ``robot.num_base_dofs`` "
"个坐标，并将映射后的关节索引加上该数量。对质量矩阵的两个广义坐标轴均应用关节排列，其他轴保持不变。"

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:242
msgid ""
"The public floating-base Jacobian body rows use the full public body order; "
"to convert a raw backend Jacobian, gather with the full body map. Fixed-base"
" raw backend Jacobians omit the fixed root, so do not apply the full body "
"map directly. Omit public/root body index 0 and convert each remaining "
"mapped backend body ID to a Jacobian row by subtracting 1. The fixed-root-"
"first invariant makes this well-defined. See "
":attr:`~isaaclab.assets.BaseArticulationData.body_link_jacobian_w` for the "
"authoritative body-axis convention. High-level articulation data performs "
"these conversions automatically."
msgstr ""
"公共浮动基座雅可比矩阵的刚体行采用完整的公共刚体顺序，转换原始后端雅可比矩阵时，应使用完整刚体映射进行 "
"gather。固定基座的原始后端雅可比矩阵省略固定根刚体，因此不能直接应用完整刚体映射。应省略公共根刚体索引 0，并将其余映射后的后端刚体 ID 减去 "
"1，转换成雅可比矩阵行号。固定根刚体始终排在首位，因此这一转换定义明确。准确的刚体轴约定见 "
":attr:`~isaaclab.assets.BaseArticulationData.body_link_jacobian_w` "
"。高层关节体数据会自动进行这些转换。"

