msgid "timestep and substeps"
msgstr "时间步长与子步数"

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:266
msgid "solver convergence"
msgstr "求解器收敛"

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:268
msgid ""
"Use :ref:`solver-differences` to diagnose and tune these differences rather "
"than treating them as ordering failures."
msgstr "通过 :ref:`solver-differences` 诊断和调节这些差异，不要将它们误判为顺序问题。"

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:273
msgid "Verification and Troubleshooting"
msgstr "验证与故障排查"

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:275
msgid ""
"When a transferred policy behaves unexpectedly, check these items in order:"
msgstr "迁移后的策略行为异常时，按以下顺序检查："

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:278
msgid ""
"Compare public ``joint_names`` and ``body_names`` with "
"``backend_joint_names`` and ``backend_body_names``."
msgstr ""
"比较公共 ``joint_names`` 、 ``body_names`` 与 ``backend_joint_names`` 、 "
"``backend_body_names`` 。"

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:280
msgid ""
"Confirm both joint and body source conventions when the policy or task uses "
"both kinds of vector."
msgstr "如果策略或任务同时使用关节和刚体向量，确认两者的源顺序约定。"

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:282
msgid "Verify observation and action dimensions against the training run."
msgstr "对照训练运行，验证观测和动作维度。"

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:283
msgid "Audit custom code for direct ``root_view`` access."
msgstr "检查自定义代码中是否直接访问 ``root_view`` 。"

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:284
msgid ""
"Compare source and target values by physical name rather than by raw column."
msgstr "按物理名称比较源值和目标值，而不是按原始列位置比较。"

#: source/concepts/joint_and_body_ordering.rst:285
msgid ""
"When name-to-vector semantics are stable but motion still diverges, classify"
" the problem as a solver-dynamics issue and continue with :ref:`solver-"
"differences`."
msgstr ""
"如果名称到向量元素的对应关系已经稳定，但运动仍有差异，应将问题归为求解器动力学问题，并继续参考 :ref:`solver-differences` 。"
